HyperCeiler attribution
=======================

This distribution contains material derived from HyperCeiler:

  Source: https://github.com/ReChronoRain/HyperCeiler
  Commit: 7266aaa0d698ad10795381c5bf23651c2e1719d0
  Copyright (C) 2023-2026 HyperCeiler Contributions
  License: AGPL-3.0-only

The adapted material includes:

  - library/provision/src/main/res/raw/glow.glsl, carried as
    app/src/main/res/raw/oobe_glow.agsl with attribution headers;
  - startup, page-transition, completion, and app-entry animation timing
    and easing behavior from the provision module;
  - the HyperOS background-blur strategy used by the startup and completion
    screens;
  - the startup arrow and button vector resources, native View layout weights,
    per-view blur blend colors, MiPro font-family selection, and static
    provision_logo_image_bg.webp fallback artwork;
  - circular PixelCopy capture and the HyperOS ActivityOptions
    makeScaleUpDown / makeScaleUpAnimationFromRoundedView invocation used
    when entering the permission page;
  - permission and basic-settings preview vectors, native page chrome
    dimensions, and the 20-percent RenderEffect rendering strategy.

These parts were adapted into native Android Views and Jetpack Compose.
Hyper Note retains its own onboarding text, permissions, screenshot choices,
feature descriptions, name, and application artwork.

